# Library of Leng: Bot1's own Faithless Looting ("draw two cards, then discard two cards") is an effect that makes Bot1
# discard, so each of the two cards is offered to the Library on its own (the rulings): the Lightning Bolt is put on top of
# the library, the Island declined and put into the graveyard. The discard is an effect's, not a cost's (CR 609.1, 701.9a);
# "instead" means the Bolt never reaches the graveyard (CR 614.6). Bot2's graveyard and library are untouched.
[Bot1 Deck]
Library of Leng
Mox Jet
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Lightning Bolt
Island
Plains
Forest
Forest
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Library of Leng.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Island)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Decline
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
Bot1.Library.Top = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Forest; Plains
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Library.Count = 13
